@startuml
title Activity 08 - Purchase Request Review Decision

|Approver|
start
:Open request detail;
:Check requester, department and dates;
:Check each item quantity, price and category;
:Check budget reservation;
:Choose Approve, Request Change or Reject;
if (Request Change?) then (yes)
  :Enter change comments;
  |System|
  :Set status = REQUEST_CHANGE;
  :Release or recalculate reservation;
  :Save comments and audit event;
  :Notify requester in-app and email;
  stop
elseif (Reject?) then (yes)
  :Enter rejection reason;
  |System|
  :Set status = REJECTED;
  :Release reserved budget;
  :Save reason and audit event;
  :Notify requester in-app and email;
  stop
else (Approve)
  |System|
  :Set status = APPROVED;
  :Keep reservation for PO conversion;
  :Save approval audit event;
  :Generate PO draft context;
  :Notify requester of approval;
  stop
endif
@enduml
